00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,684
At five degrees, the error is a tenth of a percent.

2
00:00:03,684 --> 00:00:06,250
At ten degrees, half a percent.

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:11,783
But at forty five degrees, it is eleven percent, and the formula breaks down.

4
00:00:11,783 --> 00:00:14,140
Keep the swing to a few degrees.

